# 🛡️ Data Engineering Master Course Repository - Git Ignore & Security Rules

# OS Junk & Temp Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*$*
*.tmp
*.bak

# IDE & Editor Directory Cache (Keep .agents/ directory tracked!)
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Temporary Data / Scratch Files (Keep artifacts safe)
*.tmp.sql
scratch_*.sql

# Personal Media & Unoptimized Raw Assets
PHOTOS/

# System & Environment Files
*.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
